    },
    {
      "title": "Continue the lineage",
      "body": "Replant fallen Adults to pass their weapon Trainings and Mutations to the next generation."
    },
    {
      "title": "Survive ten days",
      "body": "Face escalating opposition and elite battles across a ten-day run."
    }
